      <article class="service-card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486406146926-c627a92ad1ab?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85" alt="Commercial construction">
        <div class="service-body"><span class="icon">▦</span><h3>Commercial Construction</h3><p>Functional and aesthetic spaces engineered for businesses, offices and commercial needs.</p><a href="#contact">Explore →</a></div>
