      <article class="service-card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600210492486-724fe5c67fb0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85" alt="Interior design">
        <div class="service-body"><span class="icon">◇</span><h3>Interior Design</h3><p>Elegant interiors that balance comfort, character, functionality and your personal style.</p><a href="#contact">Explore →</a></div>
      </article>
