        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600566753086-00f18fb6b3ea?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85" alt="Renovation">
        <div class="service-body"><span class="icon">✦</span><h3>Renovation & Upgradation</h3><p>Give your existing space a fresh identity through smart renovation and upgrades.</p><a href="#contact">Explore →</a></div>
